  "id": "BIT-grafana-2026-14242",
  "summary": "Authorization bypass in the Git Sync provisioning jobs API",
  "details": "A user with the Editor role could delete, move, push or pull Git Sync managed resources in folders where they only had view access, by creating a provisioning job through the jobs resource API, which skipped the folder permission checks (incorrect authorization).",
